        metaTitle: 'Home Equity Loans UK: Remortgage, Secured Loans, Equity Release (2025)',
        description: 'Borrow against UK home equity the right way: compare remortgaging for more, a further advance, and a second-charge secured loan — plus equity release for over-55s and the repossession risk.',
